   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Certainty",
     "texto": [
      "To be sure: **Com certeza** (with certainty) or **certamente** (surely), **sem dúvida** (without doubt). Example: **Sem dúvida, é verdade** (without doubt, it's true)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Doubt",
     "texto": [
      "To express doubt: **Será que...?** or **talvez** (maybe). Example: **Talvez seja verdade** (maybe it's true). When **talvez** modifies a verb, the subjunctive is normally used; it doesn't depend on the doubt being 'big'. The verb tense adds nuances depending on context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impossibility",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something cannot be: **É impossível que** + subjunctive: **É impossível que ele saiba** (it is impossible that he knows it)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
